          "book": "HAB",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "For the stone will cry out of the wall, and the beam out of the woodwork will answer it.",
      "ko": "담에서 돌이 부르짖고 집에서 들보가 응답하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "c0f73bef2dd6a7dbf68ea62ba08b14f9636b09ec510202d33fc369ddb648c388",
      "translation_text_hash": "35c189aae31551de81c99643345a8af2b2d43d9977c80925406f1021905ea985",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
