      ],
      "en": "“Woe to him who gives his neighbor drink, pouring your inflaming wine until they are drunk, so that you may gaze at their naked bodies!",
      "ko": "이웃에게 술을 마시우되 자기의 분노를 더하여 그로 취케 하고 그 하체를 드러내려 하는 자에게 화 있을찐저",
      "source_text_hash": "9ce72fb1cae4e7e22e058b4b66b7b6cdf5c52172da1578e706e4dad2ebffc09d",
      "translation_text_hash": "b1c46b36e62b31d6c6a27d6b66d66eed13e7d32ff09e0ffa8b52b2b87875c8f9",
